      "tone": "info"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "note",
     "set": {
      "text": "all aᵢ pairwise distinct",
      "tone": "warning"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "So any model is infinite: the formula has NO finite model (verified by machine for all domains of size 1–4, and by sampling at 5–6), but it is satisfiable — e.g. (ℕ, <).",
